request.description:
Возвращает **все** активные грузы И склады в виде GeoJSON FeatureCollection.

**Пример ответа:**
```json
{
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "features": [
    {
      "type": "Feature",
      "id": "uuid",
      "geometry": { "type": "Point", "coordinates": [69.24, 41.29] },
      "properties": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "kind": "cargo",
        "title": "Замороженная говядина",
        "city": "Самарканд"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Feature",
      "id": "uuid2",
      "geometry": { "type": "Point", "coordinates": [69.35, 41.32] },
      "properties": {
        "id": "uuid2",
        "kind": "warehouse",
        "title": "Chilonzor ombori",
        "address": "Chilonzor ko'chasi 12"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

**Использование в MapLibre GL JS:**
```js
map.addSource('ctm', {
  type: 'geojson',
  data: 'https://api.centraltrademarket.com/api/v1/map/markers'
});
```
